{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender BKE API.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender BKE API.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender bke api blender bke api","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender BKE API.md","fileName":"Blender BKE API.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender BKE API","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Library and Kernel Internals]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Library and Kernel Internals","Blender blenkernel Module","Blender Main Database","Blender DNA System","Blender Datablock Lifecycle API","Blender CTX API","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender BKE API.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender BKE API.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender bke api blender bke api","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender BKE API.md","fileName":"Blender BKE API.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender BKE API","heading":"Blender BKE API","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The BKE API exposes the services of the [[Blender blenkernel Module]]. Header families such as those for worlds, cameras, objects, materials, and meshes declare functions that initialize, add, copy, localize, evaluate, and free application-specific data.\n\nThese functions commonly receive the [[Blender Main Database]] and act on structures defined by the [[Blender DNA System]]. This separates persistent record layout from the behavior summarized by the [[Blender Datablock Lifecycle API]], while the [[Blender CTX API]] handles current-context access through its own prefix.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Library and Kernel Internals","Blender blenkernel Module","Blender Main Database","Blender DNA System","Blender Datablock Lifecycle API","Blender CTX API","c